00:06:54,545 --> 00:07:00,545
Valiant is a family, animation, adventure film directed by Gary Chapman.

3
00:10:21,818 --> 00:10:27,818
Set in 1944, Valiant is a woodland pigeon who
wants to become a great hero someday.

4
00:13:49,090 --> 00:13:55,090
When he hears they are hiring recruits for the Royal Homing
Pigeon Service, he immediately sets out for London.

5
00:17:16,363 --> 00:17:22,363
On the way, he meets a smelly but friendly pigeon named Bugsy, who joins him, mainly to get away from
clients he cheated in a game of find-the pebble, and helps him sign up for the war.

6
