00:41:27,272 --> 00:41:33,272
Valiant is a 2005 animated comedy film produced by John H.

13
00:44:54,545 --> 00:45:00,545
Williams and directed by Gary Chapman.

14
00:48:21,818 --> 00:48:27,818
It is the first feature film by American animation studio Vanguard Animation.

15
00:51:49,090 --> 00:51:55,090
The ensemble voice cast includes Ewan McGregor, Ricky Gervais, Tim Curry, Jim Broadbent, Hugh
Laurie, John Cleese, John Hurt, Pip Torrens, Rik Mayall, and Olivia Williams.

16
00:55:16,363 --> 00:55:22,363
Set in May 1944, the film follows of a group of war pigeons during World War II.

17
00:58:43,636 --> 00:58:49,636
It was inspired by true stories of hundreds of pigeons
that helped the soldiers in the war.

18
01:02:10,909 --> 01:02:16,909
Valiant was released in the United Kingdom on 25 March
2005, and in the United States on 19 August.

19
01:05:38,181 --> 01:05:44,181
It received mixed reviews from critics, and grossed $62
million against a $35 million budget.

